 "text": "Register of Deeds\nOctober 18, 2026\nDavison County, South Dakota\nHome\nInfo »\nA Brief History of Davison County\nNOTICES\nCommittees\nDavison County Facts\nDirectory of Services\nEmployment Opportunities\nStaff Email\nTownship Board Members\nDavison-Hanson County Ambulance District Board\nDepartments »\nDavison County Auditor\nCommunity Health Nurse\nEmergency Management\nDepartment of Equalization\nExtension Office\nFairgrounds Complex »\nFairground Rates\nFairgrounds Rental Policies\nFairgrounds Scheduling Procedures\nHighway Department\nHuman Resources\nMaintenance Department\nPlanning and Zoning\nRegister of Deeds »\nForms\nPersonally Identifiable Information\nRegister of Deeds’ Fees\nRegister of Deeds Checklist\nFiling Liens\nSheriff’s Office »\nCivil Process & Eviction\nJail\nPistol Permits\nState’s Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeteran’s Office\nWeed Department\nWelfare Office\nCommission »\nDistrict 1\nDistrict 2\nDistrict 3\nDistrict 4\nDistrict 5\nMinutes »\nPlanning and Zoning Agenda and Minutes\nDavison-Hanson County Ambulance District Agenda and Minutes\nDrainage Agenda and Minutes\nCommission Agenda and Minutes »\nArchived Commission Minutes\nHow Do I…\nEmployment\nQuick Links\nPublic Safety Center Project\nYou are here: Home / Departments / Register of Deeds\nRegister of Deeds\nWelcome! The Register of Deeds is a county based office that works with several government entities to bring services to the public on a local level.\nThis office is a storage facility for a host of local documents from land title transfers to birth, death and marriage records.\nThis office has a wealth of information.\nDavison County Register of Deeds’ Office\n200 East 4 th Avenue\nMitchell, SD 57301\nEmail the Register of Deeds Office\nRegister of Deeds\nDanna Kolbeck\n|\nEmail Danna\nPhone: (605) 995-8616\nFax: (605) 995-8648\nMailing Address:\nDavison County, Register of Deeds\nDanna Kolbeck\n200 East 4th Ave.\nMitchell, SD 57301\nOffice Hours: 8:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m.\nMonday-Friday\n|\nDeputies:\nBridgett Nelson\nEmail Bridgett\n|\n|\nOffice: (605)995-8616\nFax: (605) 995-8648 |\nTrish Weber\nEmail Trish\n|\n|\nOffice: (605)995-8616\nFax: (605) 995-8648 |\nDarlene Bailey\nEmail Darlene\n|\n|\nOffice: (605)995-8616\nFax: (605) 995-8648 |\nProperty Protection at no cost to you: Sign up to receive Land Notification Alerts\nDavison County Web Viewer by District III\nCounty Real Estate Record Filings\nCertificate of Real Estate Value\nE-Recording County Procedures\nRecording of Real Estate Document\nRecording Fees\nChecklist to Record Documents\nDocument Standards\nPersonally Identifiable Information\nTransfer Fee Exemption Statute\nHow to Change or Add names to a Deed\nHow to Remove a Name of Deceased Owner from Title\nWhat to do if the Original Document is Lost\nLot Lines\nVital Records Department (Obtain certified copies of Birth, Death and Marriage Records)\nHow to obtain certified copies of Birth, Death, & Marriage Records\nHow to obtain a Marriage License\nSearch Births over 100 Yrs Old\nState of South Dakota Vital Records\nMilitary Discharge Filings\n​ Filing of Military Discharges\nLien Filings\nFiling of County, Federal, Mechanic’s, State Liens\nHow do I find out if there are Liens or Encumbrances Against a Piece of Ground?\nBusiness Name Filings\nFiling of Fictitious or Business Names\nUniform Commercial Code Filings (Fixture Filings attached to Real Estate)\nUCC Filings\nUCC Fee Schedule\nUCC Paper Forms\nUCC Fill and Print Forms\nOther Helpful Links:\nSouth Dakota State Website\nSouth Dakota Codified Laws\nContact Us\nDavison County, Register of Deeds\n200 East 4th Ave.\nMitchell, SD 57301\nPhone: 605-995-8616\nFax: 605-995-8648\nEmail: rodoffice@davisoncounty.org\nUpcoming Events\nSep\n10\nSeptember 10 - October 31\nRegister of Deeds Vital Record Request Wait times & Issuance Holds\nOct\n1\nOctober 1 - October 31\nSecond Half Property Taxes Due October 31st\nView Calendar\nDirectory of Services\nProperty Information / GIS\